<title>HONG KONG: Nomura Int'l adds warrants on Paliburg.</title>
<headline>Nomura Int'l adds warrants on Paliburg.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura International (Hong Kong) Ltd said on Tuesday it intended to issue a further 227 million American-style call warrants on shares of Paliburg Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>The new issue is in addition to a previous issue of 650 million warrants which launched on January 7.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$7.45	 PREMIUM	  27.85 PCT</p>
<p>ISSUE PRICE HK$0.2200 GEARING 3.59X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  07.JUL.98     LISTING DATE   29.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$7.90</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT ISSUER'S</p>
<p>			 DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
